#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:5
msgid "Metrics"
msgstr "监控指标"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:7
msgid "There are two types of metrics exporters in an Xinference cluster:"
msgstr "Xinference 集群中有两类指标导出器："

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:9
msgid "Supervisor metrics exporter at `<endpoint>/metrics`, e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:9997/metrics`."
msgstr "Supervisor 指标导出器位于 `<endpoint>/metrics`，例如 `http://127.0.0.1:9997/metrics`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:10
msgid ""
"Worker metrics exporter at each worker node, the exporter host and port can be set by `--metrics-"
"exporter-host` and `--metrics-exporter-port` options in `xinference-local` or `xinference-worker`"
" command."
msgstr ""
"每个 Worker 节点都有一个指标导出器，可通过 ``xinference-local`` 或 ``xinference-worker`` 命令的 `--metrics-exporter-"
"host` 和 `--metrics-exporter-port` 选项设置其监听地址和端口。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:13
msgid "Supervisor Metrics"
msgstr "Supervisor 指标"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:17
msgid "**exceptions_total_counter** (counter): Total number of requested which generated an exception"
msgstr "**exceptions_total_counter** （计数器）：发生异常的请求总数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:19
msgid "**requests_total_counter** (counter): Total number of requests received"
msgstr "**requests_total_counter** （计数器）：收到的请求总数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:21
msgid "**responses_total_counter** (counter): Total number of responses sent"
msgstr "**responses_total_counter** （计数器）：发送的响应总数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:23
msgid "**status_codes_counter** (counter): Total number of response status codes"
msgstr "**status_codes_counter** （计数器）：各响应状态码的总次数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:28
msgid "Worker Metrics"
msgstr "Worker 指标"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:32
msgid "**xinference:generate_tokens_per_s** (gauge): Generate throughput in tokens/s."
msgstr "**xinference:generate_tokens_per_s** （仪表值）：生成吞吐量，单位为 token/秒。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:34
msgid "**xinference:input_tokens_total_counter** (counter): Total number of input tokens."
msgstr "**xinference:input_tokens_total_counter** （计数器）：输入 token 总数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:36
msgid "**xinference:output_tokens_total_counter** (counter): Total number of output tokens."
msgstr "**xinference:output_tokens_total_counter** （计数器）：输出 token 总数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/metrics.rst:38
msgid "**xinference:time_to_first_token_ms** (gauge): First token latency in ms."
msgstr "**xinference:time_to_first_token_ms** （仪表值）：首个 token 的延迟，单位为毫秒。"

